{"id":"funeral","lemma":"funeral","pos":"adj","rank":1372,"glosses":["funerary, funeral"],"ipa":"/funeˈɾal/","forms":{"femininePlural":"funerales"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6d/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-funeral.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Cuándo es el funeral?","en":"When's the funeral?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/821251"},{"text":"Los funerales se celebrarán en la catedral.","en":"Funeral services will take place in the cathedral."},{"text":"Asistí a su funeral.","en":"I attended his funeral.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/46400"},{"text":"Mucha gente asistió a su funeral.","en":"Many people attended her funeral.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/684445"},{"text":"Te vi ayer en el funeral.","en":"I saw you yesterday at the funeral.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/556919"}]}